2bb54488\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t80f-qyz3m9ti/no-oracle-check/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-30twgyrf/c-u92tygjs/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '0aeacfe0-0fd1-4a91-ad1d-b894d9c7cadb' '--session' '77aa2758-083c-49d5-974d-c03b2bb54488' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T18:25:30.708Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"0aeacfe0-0fd1-4a91-ad1d-b894d9c7cadb","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"0aeacfe0-0fd1-4a91-ad1d-b894d9c7cadb","session_id":"77aa2758-083c-49d5-974d-c03b2bb54488","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"eb9b08cc-5d7a-47cf-b799-e07f0bf53f63","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"6329d398-de59-4e5c-835d-6fd8aec075ac","thread":"eb9b08cc-5d7a-47cf-b799-e07f0bf53f63","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-6329d398-de59-4e5c-835d-6fd8aec075ac"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-30twgyrf/c-u92tygjs/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"01dad0edd4c9f022e5efec6048e93828b8b3a6af","card_snapshot_id":"25812d39-21c1-4577-bda0-e8688bbae9bd","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-14T18:25:31.813Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"0aeacfe0-0fd1-4a91-a